  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When we take prints in-game, we currently need to click \"Save and Print\" to save the photo along with its metadata. I think it would be really helpful to have an option to take a photo with the print camera and save the image (with metadata) without actually printing it. That way, we can still get things like the world details and author’s name, even if we don’t wanna print it right away.\n\nAlso, if the print inventory is full, it would be nice if the game still saved the image and metadata to our files, even if it can’t be added to the inventory. A warning could still pop up, but at least we wouldn’t lose the print entirely that way, it wouldn’t feel so frustrating when the inventory is full.",
